# Database

See [docs/ai/dev-workflow.md](../../docs/ai/dev-workflow.md) and [docs/LEGACY_MIGRATION.md](../../docs/LEGACY_MIGRATION.md).

- Migrations: `database/migrations/`. Run `node ace migration:run`.
- Seed: `database/seeders/main_seeder.ts` — `node ace db:seed`.
- Never point migrations at the legacy stack database.
- Legacy stack import: `node ace migrate:from-legacy` — full steps only in LEGACY_MIGRATION.md.
- Reset a dev DB: `node ace migration:fresh --seed` (drops all tables, re-migrates, re-seeds).
- CMS has no native collections; `providers/cms_provider.ts` reconciles an empty registry (no-op).
